# Agent Lab needs NO environment variables on Vercel.
#
# Since the Oct 2026 provider switch, reasoning runs through Jon's OpenCode
# gateway (default https://jpecina.duckdns.org/spark/chat, configurable in
# Settings). The OpenCode API key lives only on the Oracle server, in
# /opt/spark-chat/.env — it never reaches the browser or Vercel.
#
# The QWEN_* / AGENT_LAB_ACCESS_TOKEN variables belonged to the removed
# api/qwen.js serverless proxy and are no longer used anywhere.
